Build: HealthShield — Family Health & Financial Resilience Platform

1. PRODUCT VISION

Build a polished, research-oriented, mobile-first web application called HealthShield.

Tagline:

“One family. Every health record. Every benefit. One financial safety net.”

Alternative short tagline:

“Prepare your family for the unexpected.”

HealthShield is a family-level healthcare financial resilience platform.

The central question is:

«“If someone in this family needs healthcare tomorrow, are we financially and practically prepared?”»

The platform combines four connected layers:

1. Family Health Profiles
2. Structured Health Records
3. Healthcare Benefits & Government Scheme Navigator
4. Health Savings / Financial Safety Wallet

The platform should also contain a future-facing AI Health Organizer that converts uploaded medical documents into structured, chronological health information.

The application is NOT a medical diagnosis tool.

It must NOT claim to replace doctors, hospitals, government portals, insurance companies, or official healthcare systems.

It should help families understand, organize and prepare.

