3. VERY IMPORTANT DIFFERENTIATION

Do NOT position this product simply as:

“An app to store health records.”

Digital health ecosystems such as ABDM/ABHA already support digital health records and consent-based sharing.

The product differentiation should be:

«HealthShield connects family health information with healthcare financial preparedness.»

It asks:

Health side:

“What healthcare needs does this family have?”

Protection side:

“What insurance or government healthcare benefits may protect this family?”

Financial side:

“How much healthcare-related financial pressure could this family absorb?”

Savings side:

“How much should this family realistically keep aside for healthcare?”

Shock side:

“What happens if a ₹25,000 / ₹50,000 / ₹1 lakh medical expense occurs tomorrow?”

Action side:

“What is the most practical action this family can take now?”

